# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Security + caching headers for Cloudflare Pages.
# NO EFFECT on GitHub Pages — GitHub Pages cannot serve custom headers.
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the build output root (dist/),
# where Vite copies it from public/.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is Report-Only: violations are logged to
# the browser console and reported to Sentry, nothing is blocked. After
# a clean week of normal use, rename it to Content-Security-Policy to
# enforce, and add: frame-ancestors 'none' (ignored in Report-Only mode,
# which is why it is left out below; X-Frame-Options covers framing
# until then).
#
# 'unsafe-inline' in script-src is required by legacy.js's inline
# onclick handlers; the origin allowlist still restricts where external
# scripts can load from.
#
# media-src 'self' blob: is required because Jarvis/breathwork voice
# fetches audio from the Jarvis Worker (/ops-speak) and plays it via
# new Audio(URL.createObjectURL(blob)). ElevenLabs itself is proxied
# server-side, so it never appears as a browser origin.
#
# HSTS starts intentionally low (max-age=300, no includeSubDomains) to
# mirror the cautious Report-Only CSP during cutover. Ramp it up
# (1 day → 30 days → 1 year + includeSubDomains) only after confirming
# every *.centerpost.app subdomain serves clean HTTPS — includeSubDomains
# with a long max-age is very sticky and hard to walk back.
#
# Cloudflare Pages JOINS duplicate header names with a comma (it does not
# let the most-specific path win), so Cache-Control is set per-path and
# is deliberately absent from /* — otherwise every asset would inherit a
# contradictory "no-cache, immutable".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=300
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.gstatic.com https://accounts.google.com https://www.youtube.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' https://centerpost-jarvis.medicjth.workers.dev https://centerpost-guardian.medicjth.workers.dev https://centerpost-sentinel.medicjth.workers.dev https://centerpost-pulse.medicjth.workers.dev https://*.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com https://api.weather.gov https://overpass-api.de https://o4511667943505920.ingest.us.sentry.io; frame-src https://accounts.google.com https://www.youtube.com; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; report-uri https://o4511667943505920.ingest.us.sentry.io/api/4511668027129856/security/?sentry_key=fa11403c0d7a9449b1749d199dc90395

# Hashed, content-addressed build output — safe to cache forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Non-hashed files the Service Worker relies on for update delivery —
# must always revalidate so a new deploy is picked up.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/legacy.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/config.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/app.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/kids.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/ops.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/howto.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/teacher.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/architecture.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
